      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1942320556767891621",
      "text": "[9:26PM] #IyanaIpaja #TrafficUpdate \n\nLagos-Abeokuta Expressway (Goye to Danco, via Iyana Ipaja Underbridge) is good traffic movement, with minor bustop activities under the bridge.\n\nReturn journey (Danco to Goye) is fast-moving traffic.\nIyana Ipaja Bridge (inward roundabout) is good traffic flow with no alternation delays.\n\nMosalasi inw Opeki (via Abesan Gate, Baruwa) is smooth traffic movement with no delays at Baruwa U-turn.\nReturn journey (Opeki to Iyana Ipaja Roundabout) is free-flowing traffic.\n\nMokola, Egbeda, Olugbede, Seliat, Orelope, Pipeline, and Isheri Roundabout are all good movement.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
